# Final Principle

The Sled Push develops one of the most important qualities in combat sports:

the ability to generate powerful horizontal force,

repeatedly,

under fatigue,

while preserving recovery.

For this reason,

it is one of the highest-value power and conditioning exercises in the CAS knowledge base.